OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMet to re-examine CCTV from Jill Dando
OL,4,Amurder case
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Met spokesperson said recent
OL,7,Fadvancements in CCTV enhancement
OL,8,Ftechnology had "provided investigators
OL,9,Fwith the opportunity to re-examine
OL,10,Foriginal footage from Putney Bridge
OL,11,Ftrain station".
OL,13,FThe CCTV includes an unidentified man
OL,14,Fwho was seen sprinting near the scene
OL,15,Fof the shooting, 20 minutes after the
OL,16,Fevent.
